    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξέσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is smoothed</i> or
				<i>carved</i>: hence, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξόανον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.328
			</span></i> (pl., <i><span class="en">
				Damostr.
			</span></i>); v. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξῦσμα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.134
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>abrasion,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				309c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> pl.,
				<i>shavings, filings,</i> M. Ant.<i><span class="en">
				8.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.129
			</span></i>.</div>
